    "handle": "happiness-is-our-planet",
    "title": "Our Planet",
    "collection_url": "https://happinessisinc.com/collections/happiness-is-our-planet",
    "description": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Happiness is...Our Planet. It is the 50th Anniversary of Earth Day and is a natural choice to launch our Youth Council's design. Last May, we started a youth council to mentor youth in business skills, but also to learn from them. They embarked on designing and launching a new design that spoke to them. 'Our planet' speaks to the collective, in that it's a place we all call home. Perhaps, with COVID-19, as we self isolate at home, it will spark a new appreciation and gratitude for nature and the benefits of fresh air and water. $10 from every shirt purchased will be donated to the Nature Conservancy of Canada.  Unfortunately, the Youth Council incurred a hiccup in launching, as the world has, and they have had to improvise and pivot both marketing and product. All sales will be a pre-order to be delivered once production can resume. We are proud of our youth, their dreams, and their desire to protect our future. We hope you support their initiative as well. </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\n<br> <br>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">$10 from every 'Our Planet' shirt sale is donated to the Nature Conservancy of Canada</h3>",
    "products_count": 2,
    "published_at": "2020-04-22T17:03:05-04:00",
